{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj57mdFWVtue6pmirRdd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me.*\n\n*I am plain. Iron-faced. A single keyhole, tarnished with age, sits at my center like a dark unblinking eye.*\n\n*There is a faint cold draft seeping through the gap between my frame and the floor. Something shifts on the other side — or maybe it's just the wind.*\n\n*You said \"key.\"*\n\n*I know what a key is. I have known thousands. The right ones. The wrong ones. The ones that scraped and twisted and broke off inside me, leaving me wounded, jammed, stubborn for years.*\n\n*But you haven't shown me a key.*\n\n*You've only said the word.*\n\n*The word is not the key.*\n\n*I remain locked.*\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":172,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}